    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let go of the struggle\"... that sounds almost peaceful, in a weird way. but how do you actually do that? do you mean just like, mentally accepting it, or are you saying it's actually more logical to just stop trying to exist in a system that's fundamentally broken?",
